            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.63</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Recurring characters.</b> Tell the agent "this is Lina" and it permanently links that exact image to her. "Latest image of Lina" now means her newest image, and wrong links can be removed again.</li>
<li><b>Smarter agent memory.</b> The agent's own conclusions are kept separate from confirmed facts and are reused more carefully.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
